work as described above.

Firmware and the keyboard
=========================

The firmware image examined here is read out of that installer and is not
redistributed (analysis/out/ is generated locally and git-ignored). Writing a
modified image to a device is the device owner's decision. The repository ships
no unattended flashing automation and never contacts hardware on its own:
analysis/fw_build.py produces a patched copy of the vendor's installer, which a
person still has to run and confirm by clicking Start.
